Wait, but let me check again. Maybe I should calculate the country and pop songs separately. Country albums: 6 albums * 9 songs each = 54 songs. Pop albums: 2 albums * 9 songs each = 18 songs. Then adding them together: 54 + 18 = 72. Yeah, same answer. So that seems right. The lyric sheets don't affect the number of songs, so I can ignore that part. The answer is 72.
